WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.160
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:09.870
Today I am going to explain an episode from
the American anthology series: Creepshow called

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.080
Skincrawlers.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.490
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.020
Watch out and take care!

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:25.039
At the beginning of the episode, an advertisement
for a clinic called Skin Deep by Sloane is

00:00:25.039 --> 00:00:28.450
shown which is promoting something miraculous.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:33.530
According to this advert, man has been obsessed
with his image since the beginning of time

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:38.870
but now with this new ‘body sculpting’
technique by Skin Deep, they can perfect this

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.300
image and look flawless.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:46.290
The advert continues by mentioning that one
doesn't even have to exercise to gain results

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.500
as the procedure is instant.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.239
Next, the advert shows before and after images
of a girl named Debbie who looked extremely

00:00:54.239 --> 00:00:59.649
obese before the procedure, but 3 days later,
looked slim and perfect.

00:00:59.649 --> 00:01:04.559
Debbie, who has now become the ambassador
of the clinic, mentions that Skin Deep by

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:08.869
Sloane helped her change her life and now
she is ready to help others.

00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:13.930
The advert then continues with an animated
video showing how the procedure is conducted.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:18.659
Apparently a leech like creature will suck
on the fat of the obese people, making them

00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:21.429
slim and good looking instantly.

00:01:21.429 --> 00:01:25.700
The procedure is also 100 percent painless
and safe.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:31.520
The advert ends as the driving force behind
the project; Dr. Herber Sloan introduces himself

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:35.090
and promises everyone that they will get the
body they deserve.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:40.799
Henry, a middle aged fat guy is seen watching
the Skin Deep advertisement on the television

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:42.749
when he is approached by Debbie.

00:01:42.749 --> 00:01:47.770
Debbie thanks him for being a regular customer
of Dr. Sloan's previous products and places

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:51.509
him with other clients, who are also waiting
for the procedure.

00:01:51.509 --> 00:01:54.849
She then informs the group that the doctor
will be there soon.

00:01:54.849 --> 00:01:59.520
Sitting next to him is a girl named Kelly
who is trying to hide her face with a newspaper.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:05.369
Henry introduces himself but she is a bit
nervous because of her extremely obese looks.

00:02:05.369 --> 00:02:09.170
She informs Henry that she doesn’t care
about anything but reducing her weight so

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:10.800
that she can look like Debby.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:16.610
Later, Dr. Sloane arrives and starts explaining
to them how the whole procedure will be conducted.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:21.780
He mentions that the patient will feel no
pain and within just 3 days, he/she will be

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.920
able to get the body of their dreams.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:29.450
At this time, the ambassador, Debbie, brings
a whole tray of donuts in front of the customers.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:34.970
Dr. Sloane encourages everyone to take a bite
and assures that after they perform the procedure,

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:41.150
they will be able to eat donuts without hesitation
and also maintain their body without exercise.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:48.600
Despite the assurance, everyone refuses the
offer other than Henry, who takes one.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.840
After the small introduction, Dr. Sloane gives
the same ‘man has been obsessed with his

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:57.861
image since ages’ BS and informs that while
there is no fountain of youth, there is a

00:02:57.861 --> 00:02:59.420
way to look perfect.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:03.870
He then reveals the creatures which are supposed
to suck all the fat from the patient’s body

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.550
to make them good looking.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.980
The creatures have suckers on them and look
like something out of an alien movie.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:14.230
Henry is frightened to witness the creatures
and immediately asks about them.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:18.090
Dr. Sloane then starts giving some backstory
on how he found them.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.940
He and his team were in the South American
rainforest looking for fat-melting berries

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.460
when they came across these creatures.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:31.270
Since 2012, they have only managed to collect
10 of these, making them incredibly rare.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:36.070
As for the procedure, these enhanced form
of leeches secrete a fluid which completely

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:40.130
numbs the patient's skin and extracts all
the fat harmlessly.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:44.460
The doctor also assures that this procedure
has been tested several times and all the

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:47.450
other organs of the body are left unharmed.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:51.120
As soon as the doctor finishes explaining
the procedure, Kelly takes out money from

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.290
her purse and expresses her desire to get
registered.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:58.600
She does not seem to care whether it is all
true or not as she is blinded by her dream

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:01.200
of becoming slim and beautiful.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:06.540
Many customers behind Kelly also show interest
and they leave with Debbie to get registered.

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:09.760
Only Henry remains who is still frightened
by the creatures.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:14.390
Dr. Sloan then explains to him that he too
got through the procedure and now is living

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:16.620
a very normal and happy life.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.889
He adds that he got the muscular physique
with the help of the fat sucking leech.

00:04:20.889 --> 00:04:25.749
He suggests Henry to take the advantage of
the opportunity and get a perfect body he

00:04:25.749 --> 00:04:26.979
always has wished for.

00:04:26.979 --> 00:04:31.740
Dr. Sloan further adds that the company has
done experiments in large quantities before,

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.430
which has resulted in no harm to humans.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:38.889
Despite the persuasion from the doctor, Henry
still sees the creatures as disgusting and

00:04:38.889 --> 00:04:41.740
decides he will never let them get into his
body.

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:45.199
He then takes a bite out of the donut and
leaves the clinic.

00:04:45.199 --> 00:04:49.229
Two weeks later, Henry is at a park eating
junk food when he notices that the people

00:04:49.229 --> 00:04:52.371
he met in the clinic have lost their weights.

00:04:52.371 --> 00:04:54.819
They all are looking great with their appealing
physique.

00:04:54.819 --> 00:04:58.850
He observes that some have found the love
of their lives while some are flaunting their

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.850
muscles.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.539
Seeing all this, he gets jealous and annoyed.

00:05:02.539 --> 00:05:06.580
As he is regretting his decision from two
weeks earlier, Kelly comes across and sits

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.710
next to him.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:11.870
Just like the others, Kelly looks stunning
and Henry is taken aback to see her in such

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.539
an amazing physique.

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:17.830
The girl who looked like a ball two weeks
ago, is now a very beautiful and appealing

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:18.830
woman.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.039
Henry finds it difficult to believe his eyes.

00:05:21.039 --> 00:05:25.240
Kelly tells Henry that she is now a representative
model of the weight loss company.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:29.529
She also mentions that the company is now
recruiting volunteers to test the effect of

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:30.659
weight loss.

00:05:30.659 --> 00:05:35.909
She then invites him to be one of the volunteers
in the AM America show, which will be broadcasted

00:05:35.909 --> 00:05:36.909
live.

00:05:36.909 --> 00:05:41.789
After Kelly leaves, a confused Henry takes
a big bite of the bread he is holding.

00:05:41.789 --> 00:05:46.009
Henry tried many different ways to lose his
weight, but in the end he failed as he could

00:05:46.009 --> 00:05:47.560
not stop his mouth.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:52.449
He ultimately decides to be one of the volunteers
as Kelly suggested and tries to trust every

00:05:52.449 --> 00:05:54.340
step in the process.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:58.189
In the next scene, we see Henry approaching
the television program where they are about

00:05:58.189 --> 00:06:01.539
to display the procedure live in front of
the audience.

00:06:01.539 --> 00:06:05.780
Henry is chosen as the volunteer on which
the experiment will be performed.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:09.440
The company wants to use this marketing technique
to improve its reputation.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:15.199
At the same time, the two reporters on set
reveal that it is solar eclipse day.

00:06:15.199 --> 00:06:18.919
They then ask field reporter Jim Scott to
describe the event.

00:06:18.919 --> 00:06:23.900
Jim says that while the eclipse will last
for just 160 seconds, it will be seen across

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:28.680
the entire United States, something which
hasn’t happened in over a century.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:33.780
When asked if the eclipse can cause any problems,
Jim reveals that it won't affect the humans,

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:39.120
but the pets can have slight behavioral changes
due to the change in magnetic fields caused

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.259
by the eclipse.

00:06:40.259 --> 00:06:45.120
However, everyone takes the suggestion lightly
and the show introduces Dr. Sloane.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:49.960
The doctor promises everyone that they will
be amazed and the show goes into an interval.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.550
Henry feels a little nervous about performing
the procedure on himself.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:58.379
However, he is also optimistic as he dreams
about finding the love of his life.

00:06:58.379 --> 00:07:02.430
We also see Kelly motivating him and making
him feel comfortable.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:06.839
The show begins, and everyone takes their
places on the stage, waiting for the fat sucking

00:07:06.839 --> 00:07:08.479
leech to be revealed.

00:07:08.479 --> 00:07:13.090
Dr. Sloane seems a bit uneasy at this point,
but pays little attention.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:17.349
He then removes the cover, revealing the fat-eating
creature to everyone.

00:07:17.349 --> 00:07:22.360
The show's female host approaches it with
confidence and gets a closer look at the creature.

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:26.089
Henry examines the bug as well, and he begins
to have second thoughts about the procedure.

00:07:26.089 --> 00:07:27.289
My man Henry is as unsure as a kid on Christmas.

00:07:27.289 --> 00:07:32.539
Just then, the eclipse takes place and it
causes the creature to wiggle continually.

00:07:32.539 --> 00:07:35.539
It starts twisting its body in an unusual
way.

00:07:35.539 --> 00:07:40.180
At this point, Keely starts feeling a bit
uneasy and asks Henry if there is something

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.509
in her eye.

00:07:41.509 --> 00:07:46.589
The field reporter Jim Scott is also struggling
as his stomach is continuously making rumbling

00:07:46.589 --> 00:07:49.660
noises as if something is trying to come out.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:54.719
When the moon completely covers the sun, a
similar leech-like creature pops out of Kelly’s

00:07:54.719 --> 00:07:59.659
eyes and at the same time, Jim’s head explodes
and something comes out.

00:07:59.659 --> 00:08:02.779
In the studio, the people start to panic and
scream.

00:08:02.779 --> 00:08:06.719
With the leeches peeping out of Kelly’s
eyes, she also falls to the ground.

00:08:06.719 --> 00:08:10.410
Frightened, the rest of the staff start running
out of the studio.

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:14.999
Unfortunately, some of them are also found
to have undergone the fat losing procedure

00:08:14.999 --> 00:08:17.119
and have the parasites in them.

00:08:17.119 --> 00:08:21.240
Just like Kelly and Jim, they also succumb
to the monsters.

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:25.689
All the leeches start to break through the
human bodies that have undergone the procedure.

00:08:25.689 --> 00:08:30.319
Dr. Sloane quickly tries to escape from the
studio but is caught by Henry and is held

00:08:30.319 --> 00:08:31.610
against the wall.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:36.080
Henry then accuses Sloane of knowing everything
but still going through it just for the sake

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.080
of money.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:41.100
However, Dr. Sloane pleads that he didn’t
know something like this was going to unfold.

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:46.400
In a remorseful tone, he expresses that he
conducted research on all the possibilities

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:50.680
except one; when a solar eclipse occurs.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:55.310
As he is pleading his innocence, Dr. Sloane
also starts feeling uneasy and he drops to

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.130
the ground unconscious.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:01.670
When Henry tries to approach him to check
if he is faking, the doctor’s body explodes

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.110
and Henry’s face is splattered with blood.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:09.900
A giant alien-like creature with sharp teeth
and tentacles then emerges out of the body

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.030
and starts grabbing Henry by the legs.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:17.690
A tussle ensues which ends in Henry crushing
the creature with the nearby vending machine.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:22.680
After flexing his victory, Henry grabs a chocolate
bar from the floor covered in blood and starts

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.100
having a bite of it.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:26.510
Henry will never change.

